  (text "No on-board 50R termination.\n50 ohm: use an external SMA feed-through\nterminator; input is 1 Mohm || ~3 pF." (at 33.02 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 22147f75-25c2-5dc6-9d07-76f2c4abc1c0))
  (label "GA" (at 121.92 58.42 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee29e6d4-a564-5d6b-aff7-580498ac47b5))
  (text "HF 5:1: Ctop 1.5p / Cbot 3.3p, k = 1.53/(1.53+3.3+2.4+0.3) = 0.206,\nx G 0.971 = 0.200. Ctop-GA-Rg-IN node as small as possible (pads\n~0.3 pF are part of k). Rg 10R (22-33R if step overshoot, RESULT op. 1)." (at 88.9 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b9dae130-9c0b-5bdf-a068-82737aeaedc5))
  (no_connect (at 185.42 63.5) (uuid f2de7160-45b0-5ec2-b591-9635fd09b548))
  (no_connect (at 185.42 66.04) (uuid 4c012009-0553-561d-8c85-af274f1908e6))
  (no_connect (at 185.42 68.58) (uuid 4d8fa02d-47ef-570e-a46b-d076d07bd800))
  (text "U101 CL mode: Aux_Bias = VS-,\nR_Bias 18k 0603 (wide-BW mode,\ndatasheet point 17.8k).\nEP isolated -> GND plane." (at 203.2 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fb40dd8a-4f44-5198-85fc-4b462c9f35e0))
  (text "CLH = +1.5 V" (at 172.72 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 36c9ec8d-e56a-5b6b-bc6e-f023cb05adb5))
  (text "CLL = -1.5 V. Clamps: OUT within +/-1.5 V,\ninput diodes to CLH/VS- (100 mA max)." (at 162.56 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 524481df-e09b-5e71-8388-a7062e970676))
  (hierarchical_label "BUF_OUT_S" (shape output) (at 193.04 53.34 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7c27cedc-0a76-57fe-9ad3-6d1218fdb588))
  (hierarchical_label "BUF_OUT_T" (shape output) (at 243.84 58.42 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ddf29204-04f8-538f-a684-ebb5a2e49bfd))
  (text "BUF_OUT_S = U101 OUT node: 10R + sampler bridge on the sampler\nsheet, bridge within 3 mm of the OUT pin (Zout 1.2R + 0.3 nH).\n49.9R directly at the OUT pin, then 0R/ferrite/100R position.\nBUF_OUT_T: 50R microstrip (0.36 mm, 6.06 ps/mm) to the D317 bridge\n(high-impedance end, trigger_phase): no termination at the far\nend, keep it short (< 30 mm, ~180 ps), no stubs." (at 198.12 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1dad60c7-9010-5da5-9982-aee069d0441b))
  (label "TAP" (at 60.96 111.76 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4c4d84c6-6749-50df-b468-f653b0218896))
  (label "FB" (at 83.82 116.84 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 2a62c2f2-5983-5251-9abd-0d844bcb4aaa))
  (hierarchical_label "VOFS" (shape input) (at 63.5 142.24 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 57b53d04-f478-5328-9e68-4e441a887994))
  (hierarchical_label "VNEG_REF" (shape input) (at 63.5 146.05 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid e21f1acf-1703-504d-9418-ebaac2edca83))
  (label "IN_AUX" (at 142.24 114.3 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b68106d9-bc65-5097-ba29-801fd7092456))
  (text "Servo (differential integrator, OPA197 on +/-5 V):\nLF 5:1 alpha = 100k/(3x300k+100k) = 0.100, Rin 1.000 Mohm,\n1 % 0603 string (3 x 75 V: +/-50 V peak). Tap the string at\nthe VIN pad with the first 300k, keep it off the 50R line.\nCp 18p: tap RC 90k x 26 pF = Rpar x Cint, cancels feed-through.\nLoop BW = Ga/(2 pi Rf1 Cint) = 8.8 kHz." (at 5.08 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f08bd4d0-35a0-5609-9c55-74c97196d0d6))
  (text "FB node: Gsum = 1/Rf1 + 1/Rf2 + 1/Rofs + 1/Rmid (4.7k/22k/10k/15k)\n-> LF gain alpha x Rf1 x Gsum = 0.1997 (HF gain 0.1997).\nNo trimmer: residual LF/HF mismatch (+/-15 % worst case, BUF802 Cin)\nis measured once with any 0.2-2 kHz square wave and corrected in\nfirmware (sim/bom2_input, SPEC 28). Rf1 x Cint = 4.7 us.\nVOFS = DAC1_OUT2 0.2..2.7 V via Rofs 10k, mid-scale cancelled by\nRmid 15k from VNEG_REF (-1.933 V, mcu_if): VOFS 0.2 / 1.289 / 2.7 V\n-> OUT +0.512 / 0 / -0.663 V (+/-2.5 V at the input).\nVOFS and VNEG_REF must be quiet below 10 kHz." (at 93.98 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid baf1602e-0eeb-5157-9d79-dbfd26e46b22))
  (text "+5V: C at U101 pin 1 (VS+), pin 12 (VSO+),\nU102 pin 5; 10u bulk. 0402 at the pins, via to L2." (at 254 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a0ef3034-fdbc-54ea-91d7-b48e340b1beb))
  (text "-5V: C at U101 pin 5, pin 8 (VS-), pin 10 (VSO-),\nU102 pin 2; 10u bulk." (at 254 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 47c0e46c-c0ca-5871-a58a-9137a74d5dde))
  (text "+2V5/-2V5 (clamp dividers): 1u at CLH/CLL nodes." (at 254 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid df087c00-a9ac-5771-a2d1-748a283f64f5))
  (hierarchical_label "EXT_CLK" (shape output) (at 55.88 223.52 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ac960a8b-bbfe-543f-9bce-7e9a26062ba2))
  (text "J102 EXT_CLK: 50R microstrip to the D319 bridge (trigger_phase).\nTermination at the far end preferred; R near the SMA only as DNP option." (at 5.08 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fee588a3-f29a-530e-acf0-622c039bca6c))
  (text "Protection: no external TVS (0.3-1 pF). U101 input clamp diodes to CLH / VS- (100 mA);\nCtop limits the current (100 V/ns -> 150 mA for < 1 ns); 900k string limits servo input current.\nOverload recovery 48 us (sim/bom2_input; gate re-biases through 2 Mohm, 5x faster than with 10 Mohm).\nMax input: 1 Mohm +/-50 V peak, below 50 V/ns (C101 50 V: sees <= 47.7 V; with an external 50R terminator: its rating). Linear range +/-2.5 V around the offset.\nNoise (sim): 0.57 mV rms referred to the input, 10 Hz-2 GHz. -3 dB ~2 GHz, 50R source + external terminator (real BUF802)." (at 127 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2a60de50-8ad9-5c19-9e1e-995b2c0ad3f5))
